        "textAlign": "start",
        "fontFamily": "sans-serif"
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "EXAMPLE — C4 Component: Booking API\n\nIllustrates: the third and final level of the C4 drill-down (Context → Container → Component) — the hub container's own internal structure, deliberately the busiest of the seven component diagrams since Booking API is the busiest container. Persona: the same technical/solution architect on the modernization task force.\n\nColor key: blue = internal components (matches this container's own color at Container level). Purple = human actors (shown here only via the frontends that mediate them). Other colors = other containers/external systems, all shown for context only — none are decomposed on this diagram.\n\nPart of the Meridian Rail example gallery — epic 0022 (docs/planning/epics/0022-example-diagram-gallery.md)."
      }
    },
